$ Regression coverage for mixed num/dec arithmetic (docs/architecture.md §2.1,
$ §3.4.1). num and dec share the FlyValue payload slot but are NOT
$ interchangeable bit patterns: a num's payload is a raw int64, a dec's
$ payload is a bit-cast double. Mixed-tag arithmetic must convert (round)
$ the num operand to a double, never bit-reinterpret its raw payload.

x = 3.14
y = x * 2
show(y)

show(10 / 3)
show(10.0 / 3)

show(1 < 2.5)
show(2.5 < 1)

a = 5
b = 2.5
show(a + b)
show(a - b)
show(b - a)

job add(p, q) {
    give p + q
}
show(add(2, 3.5))
